<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
The healthcare landscape continues to evolve rapidly, driven by competitive pressures, economic headwinds and shifting consumer demands to provide easier access to better care. So how can health plans maximize investments to meet these challenges? Our article <a href="https://business.teladochealth.com/resources/article/a-data-driven-approach-to-engaging-members-and-boosting-equity">A data-driven approach to engaging members and boosting equity</a>, captured from our session at the 2023 AHIP Digital, explains how investments in data and technology paired with an omnichannel engagement strategy can help healthcare organizations interact with hard-to-reach populations.<br />
<br />
I encourage you to download the article to learn how:<br />
• Reliable data that provides a holistic view of each member helps personalize communications to encourage members to use services that improve their health<br />
• Omnichannel outreach and continuous learning through pilot programs are a proven way to keep program utilization numbers up<br />
• Culturally competent communications drives far superior results to one-size-fits-all engagement strategies<br />
<br />
Moreover, <a href="https://business.teladochealth.com/resources/case-study/engaging-high-risk-medicaid-members-living-with-diabetes">this success story</a>&nbsp;from our partnership with Wellpoint, offers a more comprehensive insight into the content discussed in the article. Discover further details about their approach to engaging Medicaid members at high risk who are living with diabetes.<br />
<br />
<br />
Best,<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}</body>
